WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Setting up a new analysis: entering the website, product, market and goal.

00:09.000 --> 00:20.000
The agent starts working — ten research steps run one by one.

00:20.000 --> 00:34.000
Live research: reading your website, your competitors' sites and market sources.

00:34.000 --> 00:46.000
Each step verifies its output as it completes.

00:46.000 --> 00:58.000
The finished report opens: overall score, sub-scores and findings.

00:58.000 --> 01:12.000
Every market claim carries a numbered, checkable citation.

01:12.000 --> 01:26.000
The prioritized plan: quick wins first, then 30/60/90-day actions.

01:26.000 --> 02:06.000
Export the report as Markdown or a print-ready document.
